\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 .   I will praise you all my days
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Thou my Saviour, son of God
\par All because through Your great love
\par You have now saved me from the dead.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj All my sins You have given me pardon.
\par O my God, I'll praise Your name
\par all because through Your great love
\par You have saved me from the dead.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2. I forgive all trespasses,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  That my friends made against me,
\par  so that, You my Lord, forgive
\par   me also of my trespasses.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj All my sins, You have given me pardon.
\par O, my God, I'll praise Your name;
\par All because through your great love
\par \pard       You have saved me from the dead.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
